{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36768","headline":"送人归湘中兼寄旧知 · 罗隐","name":"送人归湘中兼寄旧知","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青溪烟雨九华山，乱後应同梦寐间。\n万里分飞休掩袂，两旬相见且开颜。\n君依宰相貉蝉贵，我恋王门鬓髪斑。\n爲谢伏波筵上客，几时金印拟西还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36768.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36768","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}